Where did my telepathy go? I ate a floating eye early in the game, got
telepathy, then suddenly (a few levels later) it was gone. I had fought
some gremlins, so I thought that they might have stolen it. I went
back, killed another floating eye, ate it, got telepathy again, went
down about 5 levels (quickly, without fighting anything significant),
and my telepathy was gone again. I even quaffed at a fountain to make
sure. I was wearing an unidentified +2 crested helmet..could that have
done it? Now my wizard is level 12, and the game doesn't seem to be
sending me floating eyes any more.

BTW, the priestess in my god's temple blessed me after a large donation,
and I was clairvoyant for a while. That times out, I presume.


